.TH RHYTHMCAT-TUI 1 "2026-10-29" "RhythmCat 3.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rhythmcat-tui \- music player (terminal frontend)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rhythmcat\-tui
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rhythmcat\-tui
is the ncurses frontend of the RhythmCat music player. It plays music
and manages the music library and user playlists in a terminal.
.PP
Audio files, CUE sheets, playlist files and folders given as
.I FILE
arguments are imported into the music library.
.PP
Press
.B ?
in the program to show all keys. Only one frontend of RhythmCat can run
at the same time.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/RhythmCat3/settings.conf
The settings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/RhythmCat3/library.json.gz
The music library and the playlists.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/RhythmCat3/tui.log
The log output.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rhythmcat (1)
